OL,3,AChris Mason: The US elections will
OL,4,Achange Trump ` how will Burnham react?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham remains in the foothills of
OL,7,Festablishing a relationship with the
OL,8,Fpresident ` so far it has amounted to a
OL,9,Fhandful of phone calls and one
OL,10,Fface-to-face meeting at the United
OL,11,FNations in New York in September.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
